          "snippet": {
            "line": 289,
            "text": "theorem slew_bound_of_rderiv {u du : ℝ → ℝ} {a b S : ℝ}\n    (hucont : ContinuousOn u (Icc a b))\n    (hu : ∀ t ∈ Ico a b, HasDerivWithinAt u (du t) (Ici t) t)\n    (hS : ∀ t ∈ Ico a b, |du t| ≤ S) {s t : ℝ} (has : a ≤ s) (hst : s ≤ t) (htb : t ≤ b) :\n    |u t - u s| ≤ S * (t - s) := by"
          },
          "declaration": {
            "id": "VoltageToBit.slew_bound_of_rderiv",
